      "old_behavior": "struct linux_i386_kernel_header 定义为GRUB内部的Linux内核setup头表示（字段：code1[0x0020], cl_magic, cl_offset, code2[...], setup_sects, root_flags, syssize, swap_dev, ram_size, vid_mode, root_dev, boot_flag, jump, header, version, realmode_swtch, start_sys, kernel_version, type_of_loader, loadflags, setup_move_size, code32_start, ramdisk_image, ramdisk_size, bootsect_kludge, heap_end_ptr, pad1, cmd_line_ptr, initrd_addr_max, kernel_alignment, relocatable, min_alignment, xloadflags, cmdline_size等），附有LINUX_LOADER_ID_*宏定义。",
      "new_behavior": "struct linux_i386_kernel_header 现在定义为上游Linux/Intel引导协议布局（字段：code1[0x0020], cl_magic, cl_offset, code2[...], setup_sects, root_flags, syssize, swap_dev, ram_size, vid_mode, root_dev, boot_flag, jump, header, version, realmode_swtch, start_sys, kernel_version, type_of_loader, loadflags, setup_move_size, code32_start, ramdisk_image, ramdisk_size, bootsect_kludge, heap_end_ptr, ext_loader_ver, ext_loader_type, cmd_line_ptr, initrd_addr_max, kernel_alignment, relocatable_kernel, min_alignment, xloadflags, cmdline_size等）。旧GRUB特定布局现保存为 struct grub_setup_header。",
      "compatibility_reason": "相同结构体类型名现在具有不同的字段布局。引用 struct linux_i386_kernel_header 成员的代码按名称访问（如 .pad1, .relocatable）将失败，因为这些字段不再存在，取而代之的是 ext_loader_ver, ext_loader_type, relocatable_kernel 等新字段。旧布局以新名称 grub_setup_header 保留，要求所有消费者更新类型引用。",
